WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hello, I'm Jose Rojas from Venezuela and I don't want to work.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
I just want the government of the United States to keep me.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
I'm Luis Flores from Honduras and since I arrived in the United States,

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
they only want to give me burgers and potatoes.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
That's not food. That's food for chanchos.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
My name is Elfegua Barca from El Salvador

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
and the truth is that I'm here in the protest just to sell pupusas.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Hello, my name is Maria Lopez from Mexico.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Here the ungrateful are Hondurans and Venezuelans.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
We Mexicans love the United States.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Look, they took away our stamps, they took away our easy money, they took everything away.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
My name is Carmen Cruz from Honduras, and not as a valiant because they took away my stamps.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.000
If you are going to deport me, do it now.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
But don't take away my food stamps because I'm missing the arepas on Sunday.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.500
Sunday. I am from El Salvador but I love the United States. Let the Hondurans and Venezuelans

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:00.340
take themselves away, they hate this country. Those who want to continue with their

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:06.340
shit, go to hell. Here is the one who really wants to live better. Long live the United States!
